[4980.603824, "o", "\u001b[?25lwhich contains nothing more than the commands to configure a lo\u001b[?25h"]
[4980.604907, "o", "\u001b[?25lopback interface).\r\nExecute the script\u001b[26;19H\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H(netmiko-lab)$ python3 se\u001b[27;26H\u001b[K\u001b[27;26H\u001b[?25h"]
